{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_title", "source_sha256": "bb51aa23498bd995309f02a31c80a6dde0f827ed16f74daeda2e04ad06360936", "ja": "ヒカリを見つけて", "zh": "寻得光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4553f8c3296212e05fd1c3c9e31ed4e3bee44a5ea22a33159c8984c7f9d57759", "ja": "ドラマの主要キャストに抜擢される琴葉。\n共演者に「アイドル枠」「純粋に芝居を見て\nほしければ俳優になればいい」と言われ戸惑\nうが、プロデューサーの言葉で、自分の意思\nでアイドルを続けている事を再確認する。", "zh": "琴叶被选拔为电视剧的主要演员。\n同台演员对她说“偶像名额”“要是想让别人纯粹看你的演技，去当演员不就好了”，让她陷入了迷茫，但在制作人的话语鼓励下，她再次坚定了自己是凭自己的意志在继续做偶像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7f7a176f42a6d370fbe31ff3eb0de8ee811bb44c8e91b448c543660df1964c4b", "ja": "数週間前、定期公演ミーティング前……", "zh": "数周前，定期公演会议前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e22ad6a0b43d037d9e7b4bcc42d33f0012381b528966456dd672c5b6ccc7b7c5", "ja": "大変だ、琴葉！", "zh": "不好了，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "85af7e6ee293f520d71157435b94acb154039d04364492a7b031138290dd9fcc", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\n定期公演のメンバー、全員揃ってます。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n定期公演的成员，已经全部到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b8f3449b7829ffec8a426e8f7840cfbe030534e8f0b10b72b0967bf0b3c06ded", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう。いや、定期公演の\n話もしないとなんだけど、その前に……！", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢。对了，定期公演的事也得商量一下，不过在那之前……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5d82f863be6bcba91d2bbce8ef73ff67ec4cecdee5811e9ccb31f379fdabf631", "ja": "実は琴葉に、朝の連続ドラマの主要キャストとして\n出演オファーが来たんだ！", "zh": "其实有人向琴叶发来了晨间连续剧的主要角色出演邀请！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "13915ada02bffa6e18baa68495bf1a445c96878936a14334603ca0b2bbc0382d", "ja": "え？\n……えええええっ！？", "zh": "诶？\n……诶诶诶诶诶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "ae077c1b5f2f4b6ef3c7378187b304a9ad268f0f9631399607d9debe06610f9c", "ja": "朝の連続ドラマって……\n半年ごとに新作が放送されてる、あの？", "zh": "早间连续剧……\n每半年播出一部新作的，那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "72bf16d9f32086776ea7d3052d8574830ded2cd9fdf2e5b3894ceed102e037ca", "ja": "近現代を舞台にした大型ドラマシリーズで、\n出演できるのは業界でも一握りと言われるあの……！？", "zh": "以近现代为舞台的大型电视剧系列，据说能出演的只有业内少数人，就是那部……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1008_p", "source_sha256": "28bc42ff02e0dd77a93b99935244074f3b117eaec6999aae86fe2dd451667f7f", "ja": "そうだ。その次回作に、主人公の娘役として\n出演してほしいっていうオファーが来たんだ。", "zh": "没错。有个邀约，希望你能在那部作品的续作中饰演主角的女儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "dad260977dcafb66175c744b827d7257e36d681ef579a74fd1e2ce85fadd1162", "ja": "そんな大きなお仕事が、オファーでですか？\n琴葉さん、すごいです！", "zh": "这么重要的工作，是对方主动发来邀约的吗？琴叶，太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "6f5385a1818a06f824c4df438ac8892cbffeff17e5f0ea43a881a81282c2115a", "ja": "琴葉の比類なき演技力が、制作陣の目に\n留まったのでしょう。真、素晴らしいことです。", "zh": "想必是琴叶无与伦比的演技引起了制作团队的注意吧。真是太了不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "c7c07d03ef7de301d569d376c9648752ee52be7ee3ec52cc7798881b12fb9298", "ja": "さすが、田中さんですね。\nおめでとうございます。", "zh": "不愧是田中小姐。\n恭喜您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "5d3b6f63ac0c31d79cc5342c77259ca011b0b345be66596df652acbbe6d96ade", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう……。\nなんだか、信じられないけど……。", "zh": "大家，谢谢你们……总觉得，有点难以置信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1013_p", "source_sha256": "443432844eb247e34dee77537ec0aa463925437dfcf4e37cba12beb2fcea4127", "ja": "俺も、連絡をもらった時は驚いたよ。\nでもこれは、琴葉の努力の賜物だと思う。", "zh": "我收到联系时也吓了一跳。  \n不过，我觉得这都是琴叶努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1014_p", "source_sha256": "798a4e8f12bcc0d40f54f2795d427fadb562faac35d9c845a03ff54176f8421a", "ja": "それで、肝心のオファーなんだけど。\n引き受けて、問題ないか？", "zh": "那么，最重要的邀约这件事……\n你愿意接下吗？有问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "1a1aaf22e3040d9d888f25eccb76218a20f29189352297dd2eede346276888c8", "ja": "っ、はい！　もちろんです！\n私に、やらせてください！", "zh": "呃，是！当然没问题！\n请让我来做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e570df1cd633b49e1c441e2877730dbd503936484bd7ff2fda7a226e54dbdacd", "ja": "わかった。定期公演の頃には、色々発表になっている\nはずだ。このチャンスを物にできるよう、頑張ろう！", "zh": "明白了。到定期公演的时候，应该会公布不少消息。为了抓住这个机会，我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3a6328b3d383873f153f5c76d60dfcf88d970628996dc841d754ed98962ce24", "ja": "……！　はい！", "zh": "……！好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "331e305d264ad279d128ab79d98856fc2e1df3a04bf14135bc09fc02e348586c", "ja": "琴葉さん、公演もあって大変だと思いますけど、\nがんばってくださいね！　わたし、応援してます！", "zh": "琴叶姐姐，既要参加公演一定很辛苦吧，请加油哦！我会为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb20e1f731d291d8cbb74f0ea79330532cb81002970c35cd93847e189e08d70e", "ja": "私もです！　毎朝琴葉さんのお芝居が観られるなんて、\nなんだかワクワクしちゃいますね♪", "zh": "我也是！每天早上都能看到琴叶小姐的演技，总觉得让人兴奋期待呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6190d6b42ef99e8db319af3261151d0c4979714316bbaa66886531bfe1629e21", "ja": "ドラマを見られる日が待ち遠しいですね。\n田中さんのご活躍、楽しみにしています。", "zh": "真期待能看到电视剧的那一天呢。\n很期待田中小姐的精彩表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "9c051a3c76140565cef73740b03606f85fd3a2245e1b59ca2ad5c7d298d8b78d", "ja": "琴葉なら、皆の期待に応えてくれる事でしょう。\n全力で挑んできてください。", "zh": "琴叶一定能回应大家的期待。\n请全力以赴去挑战吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc71fed85422f4c0c1c8de8013144e1f34c52f5efcf5f33cd0878b2f820df4f2", "ja": "が、がんばります！\n緊張、しますけど……。", "zh": "我、我会努力的！\n虽然会紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d80cc9178f60505dd0bd28fbdc3738192f27f718b4d8f52f602cd858449739f3", "ja": "俺もしっかりサポートするから、\n何かあればいつでも相談してくれ。", "zh": "我也会好好支持你的，\n有什么事随时都可以来找我商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "edd33ac2848d1b19db37a54181769a1b24284b1f63c66f6b66f645bb397100ab", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢您！\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1025_null", "source_sha256": "a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a", "ja": "数週間後……", "zh": "数周后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5b51d28edd3e59cf36898d58e490539fb15a5dd333a78cdd3965d20403f354e7", "ja": "（今日はドラマのキャスト発表記者会見。琴葉は\n錚々たる共演者達と、出番を待っているところだ）", "zh": "（今天是电视剧演员阵容公布记者会。琴叶正和众多赫赫有名的共演者一起等待出场）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "382edbd8fe2eb88b9f52ca00fb247339471aec806a207d1e9dc5a599365ab605", "ja": "（主演の檜山秋代さん、やっぱり素敵だな……。\n綺麗なのはもちろん、お芝居も圧倒的で）", "zh": "（主演桧山秋代女士果然很棒啊……\n不仅长得漂亮，演技也实在令人叹服。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "0473e3938dc3635bab4f06672e48807afba715e893dea807510e8a11357fcc01", "ja": "（他の俳優さん達も、ベテランの方々ばかり。\n……私も、がんばらなくちゃ！）", "zh": "（其他演员也全都是经验丰富的前辈。\n……我也必须加油了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc82a38930a6ed786e7189206a9334bf511b958092ff05c3d55407f1c6453537", "ja": "うう、どうしよう、心臓がバクバクしてきた……。\nだ、大丈夫。落ち着いて、深呼吸して…………。", "zh": "呜呜，怎么办，心脏开始怦怦直跳了……\n没、没事的。冷静点，深呼吸…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1030_mc", "source_sha256": "0825f7765f86ccc347b88054c35f7e1ad7cf93e4c74f4c58f71005c9d760c48e", "ja": "今回の連続ドラマ『一世劇場』（いっせいげきじょう）\nは、着物を仕立てる和裁士の女性が主人公です。", "zh": "这次的连续剧《一世剧场》（いっせいげきじょう），主角是一位定制和服的女性裁缝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1031_mc", "source_sha256": "ddabd6fd3741638f4d905458680584925aaa8f72872adafbe7c28d76557098e4", "ja": "戦前から戦後をたくましく生き抜く姿を描くという事\nですが、主演としての意気込みをお願いいたします！", "zh": "作品描绘了从战前到战后一路坚韧活下来的身姿，那么，作为主演，请谈谈您的决心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1032_hiyama", "source_sha256": "511ff79a415d7481c601d68c47426ac59bf3ae95af4c14ea10c4b97e553a00cf", "ja": "はい。初めて演じる役柄ですが、和裁士の方のご指導の\nもと、細部までこだわり抜いて演じたいと思います。", "zh": "是的。虽然这是我第一次饰演这样的角色，但我会在和裁师的指导下，力求关注每一处细节，认真完成演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1033_hiyama", "source_sha256": "40cf4f11e87c0e29667a6c8a58150ddae85c1e84aa5f85bac40e3d93598e308b", "ja": "ご覧いただく皆様の心に残る、素敵な作品になるよう\n努めます。どうぞご期待ください。", "zh": "我们会努力创作出一部能给各位观众留下深刻印象的精彩作品。\n敬请期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1034_mc", "source_sha256": "cd9cd4e0e3ed9564f8225e947743a46f0b196c2f4cfbded869976dfa2bcabf5e", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　それでは続きまして、主人公\nの娘役を演じられる田中琴葉さん、お願いいたします！", "zh": "谢谢！那么接下来，有请饰演主人公女儿一角的田中琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1035_017kth", "source_sha256": "253d38e8acac448a7c17931d6a6618d165f9f7a075106370e326b874e2fca92e", "ja": "は、はいっ！　田中琴葉です！\n今回、初めて出演させていただきます！", "zh": "是、是的！我是田中琴叶！\n这次是我第一次出演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "ca659909a6be0853fc5feb97cb11124ce400c300868ca7eb35a3582f6df2a33d", "ja": "ずっと作品を拝見してきたベテランの方々との共演で、\nすごく緊張していますが……。", "zh": "能和一直以来都很仰慕的前辈们同台演出，我非常紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1037_017kth", "source_sha256": "30196d3834176034a6d6818378dc99074bd5e49febcfca649b0baa5118d60535", "ja": "み、みなさんの足を引っ張らないように、\nがんばります！　よろしくお願いします……！", "zh": "我、我会努力不拖大家的后腿！还请多多关照……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1038_null", "source_sha256": "0f176f27429c0c06ad943d6a13d7fa4090bf0ab7358e14e204cf27762b5ac968", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャッ！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f84d01b9204a7f6447e235490ab997691ef0f9cddd1ccd82dd4715755dd3b90a", "ja": "（緊張はしてたけど、初々しくて良い挨拶だったな。\nこの後は、記者の前で取材を兼ねた読み合わせだ）", "zh": "（虽然有些紧张，但那是一次青涩而又不错的致辞。\n接下来要在记者面前进行兼作采访的剧本围读了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1040_017kth", "source_sha256": "01165747d1760ffefb21312a0c9058cfd61faf294544b629993a50edefd00a07", "ja": "この台詞、娘が初めて反発するシーンだから……\n読み合わせの前に、檜山さんに確認してみようかな。", "zh": "这句台词是女儿第一次反抗的场景，所以……\n在对台词之前，要不要先向桧山小姐确认一下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "3d27ac41697c1967e82b49dfdc0e34a020d62ecc87aad3aa3c62ff506f6951a1", "ja": "えっと……。\nあっ、あの、すみません。少しいいでしょうか？", "zh": "那个……  \n啊，那个，不好意思。可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1042_hiyama", "source_sha256": "ee467625f3242943875f513b94119f6fc60424c39b7176beef1b6b0720eb957f", "ja": "……何？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "69ca1083f59249a98050301d48eaa530212b59d27338b56d8c2795518cc72426", "ja": "あの、このシーンの台詞なんですけど。どのくらい強く\n演じればいいか迷っていて。よければご意見を……。", "zh": "那个，关于这一幕的台词。我拿不准到底要表现得多强烈，\n要是可以的话，想请您提提意见……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1044_hiyama", "source_sha256": "8ac834f1106869336ce2e9ba311a2fb8197c7ea5a31e5aadfb6d73d7a266407c", "ja": "？　別に、必要ないでしょ。", "zh": "？没什么必要吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1045_017kth", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1046_hiyama", "source_sha256": "c2ae7a0e6f06296545ce9ec30a0890cd3c3201e645cd5d6938b9d8681f00c666", "ja": "貴方、アイドルでしょ？\n役をもらえたのって、それが理由だし。", "zh": "你是偶像吧？\n能拿到这个角色，也是因为这个原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1047_hiyama", "source_sha256": "0721bfd1d69600e6d14f6348c8cd696146bc49f333afc5e9c7a53d6c08bc6b65", "ja": "アイドル枠は、若くて可愛ければいいだけだもの。\nお芝居になんて、誰も期待してないから。", "zh": "偶像这一行，只要年轻可爱就够了。\n毕竟，谁也没指望她们演戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1048_017kth", "source_sha256": "890d4f1c79f3b04ebcb4f0b675c84b996c2cea38b09a2e96997ecf08c1e865ec", "ja": "……。\nそんな……。", "zh": "……。\n怎么会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1050_p", "source_sha256": "4248d30e9e4e95cc043cc9ff071865c7a77c43e4ee3a712cd61ebd7dd4e3fe2a", "ja": "……？\n琴葉、何かあったのか？", "zh": "……？\n琴叶，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1051_017kth", "source_sha256": "5bf622058d9d043c4d71c96d5e6d731256ed3e5f00c361b996255c5e03d46803", "ja": "……！\nな、なんでもないです！", "zh": "……！\n没、没什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1052_017kth", "source_sha256": "340669d0354709669129bc8925964fa44fd59068afadf728fdb0e15332e2d2cc", "ja": "ちょっと、緊張してしまっただけで……。\nすみません、気にしないでください。", "zh": "只是有点紧张了……\n对不起，请别在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1053_p", "source_sha256": "949a8190aeb537c09109aaaaf980cb7780124e81d652ba1c6e4c9284a69db744", "ja": "そうか？\nそれならいいけど。", "zh": "这样啊？\n那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1054_017kth", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1055_p", "source_sha256": "49e796d783a08db3997aae198e0133664a10fa1f3ca8fc449cb2613f56c6e006", "ja": "（なんでもないようには、とても見えないけど……\n今聞いたところで、答えてくれそうにないな）", "zh": "（可怎么看都不像没什么事的样子……\n不过现在问她，她大概也不会回答吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1056_p", "source_sha256": "a947d7802fccdf31305e546ff53d84466cf6de6ca4e7ca15d50676ae0e32ace9", "ja": "（今日のところは、ひとまず様子を見守ろう）", "zh": "（今天就先静观其变吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1057_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1058_022ser", "source_sha256": "6a335d86b0ffb7a32dec08551f0e5042e4300b25db4ca31b3e755fc8bd7b66d0", "ja": "琴葉さん、記者会見見ましたよ！　共演者のみなさんも\n豪華でしたけど、琴葉さんもとっても素敵でした！", "zh": "琴叶姐姐，我看了记者会哦！共演的各位也都很厉害，不过琴叶姐姐也特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1059_026yur", "source_sha256": "ba2883d13e668f349cd6869fe2981f247c58a7fa146de96046e7295a28697322", "ja": "私も見ました！　ベテランの人達に負けないくらい、\nキラキラ輝いてましたね！　本当にすごいなぁ♪", "zh": "我也看了！和那些资深人士相比也毫不逊色，\n闪耀得那么耀眼！真的好厉害呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1060_017kth", "source_sha256": "e5bc59a46dbd978ed977ecde85660b4e7a5db360f5be7a014d9b29369ed370e0", "ja": "そんな、私は……。\n…………。", "zh": "怎么会，我……。  \n…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1061_008tak", "source_sha256": "c52becc60d1ca0ae2a173ad1b20918a19eeb189de7527e2378bd290896ef238a", "ja": "琴葉、どうかしたのですか？\n浮かない顔をしているようですが。", "zh": "琴叶，怎么了吗？\n看起来一副闷闷不乐的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1062_017kth", "source_sha256": "b5d8f976e6fe25205662f62247f293aa20c31520bd7ab7248f397cbb3424274a", "ja": "あ……いえ、その…………。", "zh": "啊……没什么，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1063_017kth", "source_sha256": "913d78e83edcb1cba735be6e14c4f91b548611aa961a245c81c5fe654d51bfdb", "ja": "……。\n実は、昨日……。", "zh": "……\n其实，我昨天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1064_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d7d56960735a5cd20018b9a5128fb1d8013998550fd0f1ab3662198cae0aa928", "ja": "アイドル枠……ですか。", "zh": "偶像名额……吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1065_017kth", "source_sha256": "f309cb07db830185fce648650f80f182b0af5d4ae1bc4d07cd8517ef6295b0f3", "ja": "うん。はっきり、そう言われちゃって……。\nだから、私の演技力には期待してないって。", "zh": "嗯。对方说得很明白……\n所以，其实对我并没有演技上的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1066_022ser", "source_sha256": "ec9e2d834c7679c192d30e27b320df7a365fcd54701252964e2629fd5253d033", "ja": "そんな……。それじゃ、琴葉さんが\nどんなにお芝居をがんばっても、意味がないんですか？", "zh": "怎么会……难道说，即使琴叶小姐多么努力地演戏，也没有意义吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1067_008tak", "source_sha256": "4177415533c4e361fe2bea41e3a0fa3ae34df5fd7d4d5a28423eb95174a73f53", "ja": "そんなはずはありません。\n琴葉は、今回の役に選ばれたのですから。", "zh": "不可能是那样的。\n琴叶既然被选中了这次的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1068_026yur", "source_sha256": "9540b6e3f250dc34370bdb2eef0d0dc5958b4a9c85c547459896b119bb94fda1", "ja": "でも……せっかくがんばろうとしてる時に、\n「期待してない」なんて言われちゃったら……。", "zh": "可是……好不容易打算努力的时候，却被人说“没对你抱期待”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1070_051tmg", "source_sha256": "138d4cb9c76f4af3f130b42dfe2a1042abbf68312cc81be0aa3b461838d8c33d", "ja": "田中さん。ここはひとつ、{$P$}に\n相談してみてはいかがでしょう。", "zh": "田中小姐。不如，先去和{$P$}商量一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1071_008tak", "source_sha256": "d7fa77d05991e278f1080e7b3864ff654f546ccfa8d1d7e7ef34822a4df380df", "ja": "私も、そう思います。{$P$}なら、\nそのような事はないと……琴葉の実力だと仰るかと。", "zh": "我也这么认为。如果是{$P$}，一定会说并非那种事，而是琴叶的实力吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1072_017kth", "source_sha256": "97f98d49859f9a794806b56ecc2f8aa4a7e39fc022793132b769c81ca76b5c54", "ja": "うん……。\nそうだね……。", "zh": "嗯……\n说得也是呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1073_017kth", "source_sha256": "a2c29da94a257d59589f9ba69c36cbcaa7ac25400229c8e43aa10c24904b5d85", "ja": "みんな、心配かけてごめんね。私は大丈夫だから……\n明日から定期公演のレッスンだし、がんばろう！", "zh": "让大家担心了，对不起。我已经没事了……\n明天就要开始定期公演的排练了，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1078_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1079_017kth", "source_sha256": "d91fb02e23d0d7490ac78a07fe6c093cb9c642f382079f2a5cdffaa3be857ff4", "ja": "「あの、お母さん。大事な話があるの」……。\nこんな感じかな……。", "zh": "“那个，妈妈，我有件重要的事要跟你说……”……。\n大概是这种感觉吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1080_hiyama", "source_sha256": "8a38c64d27bb5d255754371b651d7f6d0759fbc3214a8319e12e6835f6064a96", "ja": "あら、稽古前に自主練？\nずいぶん熱心だけど、何故？", "zh": "哎呀，排练前在自主练习吗？\n明明相当投入呢，为什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1081_017kth", "source_sha256": "75a1f394e6efe6f5bba719503a6cab1ef8e1b5885389ba995fc823fc2e5cd9a4", "ja": "それは……その。\n私、お芝居が好きなんです。", "zh": "那是因为……那个。\n我很喜欢演戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1082_017kth", "source_sha256": "cc32600ca27f888035128281097b8cc5557b4a00941d375807838957153f6cd0", "ja": "だから、今回の役をいただけたのも、\n演技で認められたんだと思って……うれしくて。", "zh": "所以，这次能拿到这个角色，我觉得也是因为我的演技得到了认可……真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1084_017kth", "source_sha256": "04a0eaf266278abdb3af183e1e500c656c2a4cfd6c9171c8214fb3f508c74cb8", "ja": "だから……もし、本当は違う理由だったとしても。\n私ががんばらない理由には、ならないので。", "zh": "所以……就算真正的理由并不是这样，也不能成为我不努力的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1085_hiyama", "source_sha256": "e678cef25ce87a7e9ed4252b3306888e2244dc09699fe24293f6b62ff709038c", "ja": "……そう。", "zh": "……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1086_hiyama", "source_sha256": "7ec2f7d0bfca61fbe66614a07b5ea6eb411a735db2b5aa55aa71a71662d6ba6d", "ja": "ならいっそアイドルを辞めて、演技に専念したら？", "zh": "既然如此，不如干脆放弃偶像事业，专心演戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1087_017kth", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1088_hiyama", "source_sha256": "592262e9e5bd7f06a8e1cfea1c6c5e99101cd1c52dddfa658c12236a8fa31a63", "ja": "俳優になればいいじゃない。\n純粋に芝居だけを見てほしいなら、尚更。", "zh": "当演员不就好了吗。\n如果只是想让大家纯粹欣赏演技，那就更应该这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1089_hiyama", "source_sha256": "3806a8fb4f3eaca0898dc288a5b4d9e9e470000c89adfdce333382d84507fc6d", "ja": "そうすれば、誰も貴方を侮ったりしないと思うけど。", "zh": "这样一来，我想就不会有人小看您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1090_017kth", "source_sha256": "2d0dce58a54479dc2db538e5121a0fc2a360b7e4f04d5e904acd7f98859280cf", "ja": "……。\nアイドルを……辞める……。", "zh": "……。\n不再做……偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1092_director", "source_sha256": "8eb2a10605fd685006b8594d314acdfd7f81a73449735c1432c9c0f89636a4bc", "ja": "それじゃあ、今の感じでもう一度！\nシーン13、お願いします！", "zh": "那就保持刚才的感觉，再来一次！\n场景13，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1093_017kth", "source_sha256": "2b4418827527d8356328c1e1fbb4cb4dd90f86e46ec8a91b42782dccd2ed05d3", "ja": "（アイドルを……辞める……。\n純粋に、お芝居だけを見てもらうために……）", "zh": "（辞去偶像的工作……\n为了让大家纯粹地欣赏我的演技……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1094_017kth", "source_sha256": "9347555070d168dd93a0285771d3ef664add867effe7964e8266cba01fba00b9", "ja": "（でも、私がアイドルじゃなかったとしたら……。\n私は、このドラマに出られたのかな……？）", "zh": "（但是，如果我不是偶像的话……。\n我还能出演这部电视剧吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1095_017kth", "source_sha256": "8db3b1487a885661197a2bf31e14100f5eb2e7f013ff4b91c06eca001dd41281", "ja": "私は……。", "zh": "我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1096_staff", "source_sha256": "ab87fc60337eaae0af019166d36dff88492521c119f943dd446787925fbde15b", "ja": "田中さん！\n何ボーッとしてるの、出番だよ！", "zh": "田中小姐！  \n你在发什么呆呢，该你上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1097_017kth", "source_sha256": "422aa307bcafd1bd5d9d11673b791cbdffadb61793efdafdb4c6cab66466f872", "ja": "はっ！？　すみませんっ！", "zh": "啊！？对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1098_017kth", "source_sha256": "af163269782d447a1f24043c16c59ff00c779eb30662e61428f90c25934b03af", "ja": "「あの、お母さん。大事な話があるの」……\nあ、あれ？　えっと、次は……。", "zh": "“那个，妈妈。我有重要的事跟你说”……\n奇、奇怪？呃，接下来是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1099_kantoku", "source_sha256": "6e3768ae65fa2c0e0ef14c6415924bbb94c1642e223927491d1a5a81888683fd", "ja": "あれ、台詞飛んじゃった？　台本はちゃんと\n入れてきてくれないと困るんだよねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀，忘词了吗？要是不好好把剧本\n记熟就过来，可是会让人很困扰的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1100_017kth", "source_sha256": "3483d585b5cc21c3d06715775ff0ed744ab8b7f5735a7e169b40aba9f13f677e", "ja": "っ……すみませんっ！\nもう一度お願いします！", "zh": "……对不起！请再来一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1101_kyouensya1", "source_sha256": "9df988dfe62fe59fe5bdfd0e02da45c5b652fa82fb20c962fdb7809a7c5d2cf7", "ja": "何？　あの子。ミスばっかりじゃん。\nったく、これだからアイドルは。", "zh": "搞什么？那孩子净出错。  \n真是的，所以说偶像就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1103_017kth", "source_sha256": "7a42a580c91d05fbcb2f9754bf734baf98ac1b6021a584ba05ad1bb66ca165e4", "ja": "はぁ…………。あんな偉そうなこと言って、\nなんにも上手くできないなんて……。", "zh": "唉…………明明说了那么了不起的话，却什么都做不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1104_017kth", "source_sha256": "a6dc7b0e4661295c7c4103fd0a35c16e4ffd88f599625c5e8f1d60f3b9ee441a", "ja": "お芝居だけは、ちゃんとできると思ってたのに……\nこれじゃ、私……。", "zh": "我还以为，至少演戏能好好做到的……  \n这样下去，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1106_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c094dfed21de91429d3cb49a7ccd43b86f749b55508280a940e20a8f4e359a8", "ja": "スマホにメッセージ？\n誰だろう……。", "zh": "手机上的消息？\n会是谁呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1107_017kth", "source_sha256": "84195a23bbfc01852a8e37fa013fa227000a4a18d2879bf8ec2516a93c87ff3d", "ja": "あ、{$P$}から。\nえっと……「今から迎えに行くよ」。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}发来的。\n呃……“我现在去接你”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1109_p", "source_sha256": "234b68296a63a6b39b62b1de330b310e588bb3915e92e15a20f70cc0ecbc8bdf", "ja": "お疲れ様、琴葉！\n遅くなってごめん。", "zh": "辛苦了，琴叶！\n抱歉来晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1110_017kth", "source_sha256": "091197121e9396d9519009d2054b32ad8b6875ac1fcf0ab052bab407a031fa23", "ja": "大丈夫です。それに、{$P$}に\nメッセージをもらって、うれしかったです。", "zh": "没关系的。而且，能收到{$P$}\n发来的信息，我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1111_017kth", "source_sha256": "7b80357fceb20de19abedbe3b9e159ea810c0128ad36c2146dd44f55821b34f6", "ja": "私は、{$P$}に\n見つけてもらったんだって……思い出せたから。", "zh": "因为我想起来了……是{$P$}发现了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1112_p", "source_sha256": "6a41b2944739b1523efccf398726705867f63ffa74f708b848a993fb2df4216e", "ja": "？　琴葉……？", "zh": "？　琴叶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1113_017kth", "source_sha256": "43f2de7a6d216a4cd3df7920edce5503958fd18d9ed3403d4acc5e12002ad9a3", "ja": "っ……す、すみません。\n私、ちょっとヘンですよね。", "zh": "……对、对不起。\n我、我有点奇怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1114_p", "source_sha256": "6ea09276e44b7dd1dc254edeab4f55d200e098a2dd65f293f39ba2873bd181ab", "ja": "……。\nやっぱり、何かあったんだな？", "zh": "……果然是发生什么事了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1115_017kth", "source_sha256": "29b08644cbed59495a8ee1a7dd9ec4e21553e9589392e4eba8208ea0a0f92cfb", "ja": "……先日は、なんでもないなんてごまかしたりして、\nすみませんでした。", "zh": "……前些天还敷衍地说什么都没有，真是对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1117_p", "source_sha256": "c04431e2af70f6c111a8812b9db118442c1b3aea7f3ef6ed9e4116204f46e270", "ja": "そうか……\n檜山さんが、そんな事を。", "zh": "这样啊……\n没想到檜山先生竟然会做那种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1118_017kth", "source_sha256": "c994ba2d83ab82819fc91e472a2365200bc971c9be96ac6fd2dffdb6cc610006", "ja": "はい。あの時は混乱してしまって、\nちゃんと話せそうになくて……すみません。", "zh": "是的。那时候我太混乱了，感觉没法好好说话……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1119_p", "source_sha256": "7219a4c0dceb1ab3427b5c85d254a2bfae7a94a9210fe7f5f1df00b3f07f383f", "ja": "いいよ。\nでも、本当にそれだけか？", "zh": "没事的。\n不过，真的只有这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1120_p", "source_sha256": "bd040044a5460201b398f322c17bc1ccedc6496f6a5819727e2b9c289702a4a0", "ja": "少し、迷ったんじゃないか。\n「アイドルを辞めようか」って。", "zh": "你是不是稍微动摇过。\n想着“要不要辞去偶像的工作”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1121_017kth", "source_sha256": "5b3f743ce076ff6f10ba71516f6edfad3ffc30dc132c173294a1fb42cfebd5be", "ja": "っ、それは……。", "zh": "呃，那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1122_p", "source_sha256": "a57c94827eba5793c6968f9baa53a9b2ddc8e94b74fc0389ec0561bd2e37ab70", "ja": "隠さなくてもいい。一生懸命やっている事を\nそんな風に言われたら、誰だって考えるだろうから。", "zh": "不用藏着。要是自己拼命努力的事情被人那样说，换作是谁都会多想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1123_p", "source_sha256": "c36059212f27c07b78d559442e6785d488f6fcdc5a8c0c4a2e17ffafea37217d", "ja": "今回、琴葉が選ばれた理由が「アイドルだから」……\nというのは、可能性としてはゼロじゃない。", "zh": "这次琴叶被选中的理由是“因为她是偶像”……这种可能性也不能说完全没有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1125_p", "source_sha256": "a47e74d6f05b7bdd47df2323f19a88f1abafeeac2581ee26a24807c543fa3bd1", "ja": "でもそれは、普段ドラマを観るのとは違うファン層\nだったり、新しい風としての期待でしかない。", "zh": "但那也不过是期待着与平时看电视剧的粉丝群体不同，或是把她当作一股新风而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1126_p", "source_sha256": "e70e5058696f3a02f89f213b086ec4926eecf971ef11af2e700f452699ae5aa8", "ja": "役柄として任せられた内容は、\nそれだけでこなせるほど簡単じゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "作为角色所被托付的内容，\n我觉得可没有容易到光凭那些就能应付好哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1128_017kth", "source_sha256": "476e840025ba59fa9297e9852f4aded59da96dfc9c1e9d5fc92f88c87571f294", "ja": "……。{$P$}は、\n先日の会見の記事を、読みましたか？", "zh": "……。{$P$}，\n您看前几天记者会的报道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1129_p", "source_sha256": "fd072de23ea134bc596219eb2737a19046f30245468c80ba9d5038260c9f7f3e", "ja": "ああ。スポーツ紙とか週刊誌とか……\nひと通り読んだと思う。それがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "啊。体育报纸、周刊杂志什么的……\n我应该都大致看过了。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1130_017kth", "source_sha256": "217ce4d055bc768360683fa65b4c138fb82cc758357fb646cfd315fff5e0e4a5", "ja": "記事では、私の事も紹介されていましたよね。\n『期待の新星』ってキャッチコピーで。", "zh": "那篇报道里，也介绍了我吧。\n用的是『备受期待的新星』这个标语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1131_017kth", "source_sha256": "d60da3b75727cf49a69928df4dbef4052235e33921be272f59c5c71944ce9fd6", "ja": "でも私は、そんな風に言ってもらえるような……\nそんな、すごい人間なんかじゃないです。", "zh": "可是，我并不是那种……配得上别人这样称赞的了不起的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1132_017kth", "source_sha256": "0e2cd20ece70a4fdd7933ef73bef94df5884c2329d4f12f2a52a9a68c0779690", "ja": "本当の私は、うじうじしていて。\n上手くできない事に落ち込んでばかりで……。", "zh": "真正的我，总是犹犹豫豫的。\n总是因为做不好事情而消沉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1134_017kth", "source_sha256": "fcb038849278eeb5e4369ad19ae83f6f1816dbe1f934daae54023002278ad640", "ja": "でも、そんな私を、{$P$}は\nアイドルにしてくれました。だから……。", "zh": "可是，{$P$}先生却让这样的我成为了偶像。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1135_017kth", "source_sha256": "c7c45f6a25e0b5e3a0b9f1a095e3142bafbbc13a56719e2798a51f49c9d0ad06", "ja": "だから私は、女優じゃなくて……\nアイドルとして、がんばりたくって……。", "zh": "所以我不想当女演员，而是……想作为偶像努力下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1136_p", "source_sha256": "5d91e0f85f8f2555793401dd298776fba5321198cd13c052753addc342edb0fd", "ja": "……。\n琴葉。ひとつ聞きたいんだけど……。", "zh": "……。\n琴叶。我想问你一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1137_017kth", "source_sha256": "17c7161aadc6c9ec8a4d203961b7ae9a45bbdcf6f128e3f536ee5609b03683d5", "ja": "？　はい。", "zh": "？好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1138_p", "source_sha256": "1d688610a14f24a19938a19a461a444afc8c99e0f497e8562039cb1690b8bf36", "ja": "琴葉が今ここにいるのは、\n『プロデューサー』への責任感からなのか？", "zh": "琴叶现在之所以会在这里，是因为对『制作人』的责任感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1139_017kth", "source_sha256": "7cf54a36579c976a2013010a2f8a82ad09b58806c8ec4b4edfaf376f79ef0f76", "ja": "っ……！\nい、いいえ！", "zh": "呃……！\n不、不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1140_017kth", "source_sha256": "b482a5e7fad9d2debb7be8f97de34a13c33c74e4dd115d4ba44595c3699f22b2", "ja": "そうじゃないです。\n私は……私は、自分の意志で……。", "zh": "不是那样。\n我……我是出于自己的意志……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1142_017kth", "source_sha256": "be964cd1981f1b9cb74444fad9e829ad75d04527be8342926e4ac72b51fba329", "ja": "私が、あのステージに立ちたいから！\n自分がアイドルでいたいから、ここにいます！", "zh": "因为我想站上那个舞台！\n因为我想继续做一名偶像，所以我才在这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1143_p", "source_sha256": "d7bc66d7f943f7d76c770386f30386e5fe2e934137e92e8541e8b02d96848d17", "ja": "うん。なら良かった。\n……明日も、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "嗯。那就好。\n……明天也要加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1144_017kth", "source_sha256": "754cbd7322322b1b9d8013dc7f06a2d62ec5516884b24b7278b52aab16eefcf6", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nはい！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_155_1145_p", "source_sha256": "461dd1db2e0d95f3850fd2a9a2ef7a0fef70a0ccf042fa84182893ab0b5b5031", "ja": "（琴葉の瞳に、もう迷いの色はない。強い意志は\n光となって、彼女を更に輝かせてくれるだろう）", "zh": "（琴叶的眼中已经没有了迷茫。强烈的意志化作光芒，一定会让她绽放出更加耀眼的光彩）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
